   "t": "It's late. The restaurant is closing, and Max is still standing in the kitchen, waiting to be thrown out. Instead, Chef Barinov gives him an unexpected order, and Max wonders why the chef changed his mind. A kitchen helper called Ainura asks the same question. Here it is in Russian first.",
